<title>CANADA: Canada C$3.0 bln 1999 bond yields 4.447 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$3.0 bln 1999 bond yields 4.447 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$3.0 billion auction of 4.00 percent bonds due March 15, 1999 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>		   AVG     4.447	99.156  PCT AT</p>
<p>		   LOW     4.425	99.197  HI YIELD</p>
<p>		   HIGH    4.470	99.112   29.800</p>
<p>The bonds will be dated and delivered on March 17, 1997.</p>
<p>The outstanding debt of the issue totals C$6.0 billion. Bids from primary dealers totalled C$6,647.95 million, including C$59.45 million non-competitive tenders at the average yield.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
